{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02394","headline":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 十七 · 韦渠牟","name":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舞凤凌天出，歌麟入夜听。\n云容衣眇眇，风韵曲泠泠。\n扣齿端金简，焚香检玉经。\n仙宫知不远，只近太微星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦渠牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}